# App specific
*.mobileprovision
# Entitlements files are usually machine/Xcode-generated and gitignored by
# convention, but this repo's two are small, hand-authored, secret-free
# config (just the shared App Group ID for the Now Playing widget) that
# the build genuinely depends on — see project.yml's CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS
# settings. Without committing them, a fresh clone can't build at all
# (CODE_SIGN_ENTITLEMENTS pointing at a nonexistent file fails the build),
# so they're explicitly un-ignored rather than left to the blanket rule.
*.entitlements
!Sources/YTMusicApp/Resources/YTMusicApp.entitlements
!Sources/YTMusicWidget/YTMusicWidget.entitlements

# Secrets — real values are gitignored; Config/Secrets.example.xcconfig
# (committed) documents every key and is the template to copy from.
Config/Secrets.xcconfig

# Test results — generated by scripts/run_tests.sh, not committed.
test-results/
